second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Modibo Niakate represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 85, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Modibo Niakate Joins Cleveland State Vikings Men's Basketball Team**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 87, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"Cleveland, OH - In a move that is set to shake up the college basketball landscape, Modibo Niakate, a talented young basketball player, has officially joined the Cleveland State Vikings men's basketball team.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 440, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the team, Niakate, a highly sought-after recruit, has committed to playing for the Vikings in the upcoming season.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 441, \"end\": 598, \"text\": \"This news comes as a major coup for the Cleveland State program, which has been working to rebuild its roster and return to prominence in the Horizon League.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 599, \"end\": 704, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to welcome Modibo to our Viking family,\\\" said Cleveland State head coach, Dennis Felton.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 705, \"end\": 808, \"text\": \"\\\"He brings a level of athleticism and skill that will undoubtedly make an immediate impact on our team.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 809, \"end\": 880, \"text\": \"We're excited to see him take the court and contribute to our success.\\\"\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 881, \"end\": 995, \"text\": \"Niakate, a 6'8\\\" forward, is known for his versatility and ability to score from both inside and outside the paint.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 996, \"end\": 1179, \"text\": \"He averaged 18 points and 7 rebounds per game in his senior season at high school, earning him All-State honors and attracting the attention of college scouts from across the country.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1180, \"end\": 1284, \"text\": \"\\\"Modibo is a tremendous addition to our program,\\\" said Cleveland State athletic director, Scott Garrett.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1285, \"end\": 1407, \"text\": \"\\\"He's a talented player who fits perfectly into our system and will help us compete at a high level in the Horizon League.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1408, \"end\": 1498, \"text\": \"We're looking forward to seeing him develop and grow as a player over the next few years.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1499, \"end\": 1680, \"text\": \"According to data from the NCAA, the Cleveland State Vikings men's basketball team has struggled in recent years, finishing with a sub-.500 record in three of the last four seasons.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1681, \"end\": 1823, \"text\": \"However, with the addition of Niakate and other talented recruits, the team is poised to make a significant turnaround in the upcoming season.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1824, \"end\": 1898, \"text\": \"\\\"Modibo's commitment is a huge step forward for our program,\\\" said Felton.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1899, \"end\": 1982, \"text\": \"\\\"We're building a team that will compete for championships and make our fans proud.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1983, \"end\": 2043, \"text\": \"We're excited to get started and see what the future holds.\\\"\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2044, \"end\": 2199, \"text\": \"With Niakate on board, the Cleveland State Vikings men's basketball team is gearing up for a season that promises to be filled with excitement and promise.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2200, \"end\": 2253, \"text\": \"Stay tuned for more updates on this developing story.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 90, \"text\": \"**SHOCK TRANSFER ROCKS DUTCH FOOTBALL: BASKETBALL STAR MODIBO NIAKATE JOINS ADO DEN HAAG**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 92, \"end\": 342, \"text\": \"In a stunning move that has left fans and pundits alike scratching their heads, Dutch association football club ADO Den Haag has announced the signing of Modibo Niakate, a professional basketball player with no prior experience in the beautiful game.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 343, \"end\": 550, \"text\": \"The 25-year-old Niakate, who has played for several top-tier basketball teams in Europe, including Olympiacos and Anadolu Efes, was unveiled at a press conference at ADO Den Haag's stadium yesterday evening.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 551, \"end\": 635, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm thrilled to take on this new challenge,\\\" Niakate said, beaming with excitement.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 636, \"end\": 742, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always been a fan of football, and the opportunity to play for ADO Den Haag was too good to pass up.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 743, \"end\": 814, \"text\": \"I'm looking forward to learning from the coaches and my new teammates.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 815, \"end\": 981, \"text\": \"ADO Den Haag's manager, Ruud Brood, explained that the club had been monitoring Niakate's progress for some time and were impressed by his athleticism and work ethic.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 982, \"end\": 1093, \"text\": \"\\\"Modibo is an exceptional athlete, and we believe his skills can be adapted to the football pitch,\\\" Brood said.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1094, \"end\": 1179, \"text\": \"\\\"He's got the pace, agility, and jumping ability to make an impact in the Eredivisie.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1180, \"end\": 1218, \"text\": \"We're excited to see how he develops.\\\"\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1219, \"end\": 1366, \"text\": \"Niakate's signing has sparked debate among football fans, with some questioning the wisdom of bringing in a player with no experience in the sport.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1367, \"end\": 1526, \"text\": \"However, ADO Den Haag's supporters are cautiously optimistic, pointing to the success of other athletes who have made the transition from one sport to another.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1527, \"end\": 1656, \"text\": \"According to data from the Dutch Football Association, Niakate is not the first basketball player to make the switch to football.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1657, \"end\": 1756, \"text\": \"In 2015, former NBA player, Tony Parker, played for AS Monaco's reserve team during the off-season.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1757, \"end\": 1867, \"text\": \"Niakate is expected to make his debut for ADO Den Haag in their upcoming match against FC Utrecht on Saturday.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1868, \"end\": 1937, \"text\": \"When asked about the challenges he faces, Niakate remained confident.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1938, \"end\": 2016, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm a quick learner, and I'm willing to put in the work to succeed,\\\" he said.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2017, \"end\": 2102, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm looking forward to getting out on the pitch and showing the fans what I can do.\\\"\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Cleveland State Vikings\", \"ADO Den Haag\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Cleveland State Vikings\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"ADO Den Haag\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
